  "finalDifficulty": 0,
  "shortDescription": "Carronade sends her thanks for the assist, Commander—we're doing Gwydion Company a solid that a lot of other mercenary commands wouldn't. Our friends have taken shelter in a subterranean bunker, and a Steiner strike team has them penned in. Carronade needs us to engage and destroy the Lyrans so that she and her people can escape.",
  "longDescription": "You know the drill, Commander. Get in there, take down the strike team, and rescue Gwydion Company. I'll call out targets for you as I see 'em.",
